sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant API as WebApi Controllers
    participant FH as Feature Handlers
    participant Repo as Repository/UoW
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PayOS as PayOS Service
    participant Noti as NotificationService
    participant Hub as RestaurantHub

    Note over Client,API: API inventory<br/>Auth, Account, Area, Category, Product, Table/QR<br/>Order & OrderItem, Cashier/Bill, Payment, Customer<br/>WorkSchedule, Dashboard

    Client->>API: HTTP request
    API->>FH: Execute(command/query)

    alt Validation/Auth/Not-found failure
        FH-->>API: Result.Failure(message)
        API-->>Client: 400/401/403/404
    else Domain processing
        FH->>Repo: Read/Write aggregates
        Repo->>DB: SQL + COMMIT
        DB-->>Repo: Result rows

        alt Business/Rule failure
            FH-->>API: Result.Failure(message)
            API-->>Client: 400/409
        else Success
            FH-->>API: Result.Success(data)
            API-->>Client: 200/201
        end
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Hub: Realtime Order/OrderItem updates
        FH->>Noti: NotifyRoleGroups(event)
        Noti->>Hub: Push to role groups (role:{name})
        Hub-->>Client: SignalR event
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 235)
        Note over Client,PayOS: Payment (create-link/webhook)
        FH->>PayOS: CreatePaymentLink / VerifyWebhook
        alt Provider/signature/tx/bill invalid
            FH-->>API: Failure
            API-->>Client: 400/404/500
        else Payment success
            FH->>Repo: Update Transaction + Bill + Order + Table/QRSession
            Repo->>DB: COMMIT
            API-->>Client: 200
        end
    end
